<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal announcement of EDP sale price delayed.</title>
<headline>Portugal announcement of EDP sale price delayed.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A news conference to announce the pricing of the partial privatisation of state electricity concern EDP has been delayed because the cabinet meeting is still continuing, government officials said.</p>
<p>The news conference had initially been set for 1400 GMT. It was not known when the announcement would now be made.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
